  message: "Done in PR #1834 (dev f63509447f). The id-format:F3 round-trip checks (kind slot registered, kind slot == Symbol.kind, name slot non-empty) went warning -> error, and VALIDATION_BASELINES went 11 -> 0 on all four substrates. Gating backlog drained: WI-pubiv, WI-kugaj and the tsconfig fold earlier; WI-lusoh (#1832) and WI-pusan (#1833) today. LIVE on merged dev: hypergumbo run on a copy of tests/fixtures/schema-coverage-corpus gives rc=0 and validation_report violations 0 (all classes 0). A legacy-shape cuda id (cuda:k.cu:1-2:k:global on kind=function) through _check_id_roundtrip now yields two 'error' violations. Surveys swept at 0 before the flip: grpc, whisper.cpp, sherpa-onnx, envoy-half, torsocks, modsecurity, shaka-packager, plasma-desktop, aardvark-dns."  # 784e
